{title: O Meri Laila}
{artist: Atif Aslam}
{key: D}

{c: Verse 1}
[D]Patta Anaaro Ka Patta,        Chinaro Ka [A]Jese [D]Hawaaon Me
Aise Bhatakta Hu Din Raat,        Dikhta Hu [A]Maiteri [D]Raahon Me
[G]Mere Gunaaho Me,        Mere Swaalon me Sha [D]amil Tu
[G]Bhuli Athanni Si,        Bachpan Ke Kurte Me Se [A]Mil Tu
[D]Rakhu Chupa Ke Mai Sb Se Wo Laila,        [D]Maangu Zamaane Se Rab Se Wo Laila
[C]Kab Se Me Tera Hu,        [G]Kb Se Tu Meri [D]Laila
[D]Teri Talabb Thi Han Teri Talab Hai,        [D]Tu Hi To Sab Thi Haa Tu Hi To Sab Hai
[C]Kab Se Me Tera Hu [G],        Kb Se Tu Meri [D]Laila
[D]O Meri Laila ..Laila,        [G]Kahwab Tu Hai Pehla
[C]Kab Se Me Tera Hu,        [G]Kb Se Tu Meri [D]Laila
Maangi [D]Ti Duwaayein Jo,        [A]Unka Hi [G]Asar Hai [A]Ham Sath [D]Hai
Na Ya [D]ha Dikhaawa Hai,        [A]Na Yaha [G]Duniyaa [A]Jazbaat [D]Hai
Yaha [G]Pe Bhi Tu Hooro Se [D]Jada Hasin,        Yani [G]Dono Jahaano Me [D]Tum Sa Nahi
Jeet [A]Li Hai Aakhir [C]Me,        Hum Dono [G]Ne Ye Baazi [D]yaan
[D]Rakhu Chupa Ke Mai Sb Se Wo Laila..        Zaai [D]qa Jawani Mein
[A]Khwabo me [G]yaar Ki [A]Mehmani [D]Me,        Marzi [D]yaan Tumhaari Ho
[A]Khush Rahu [G]mai Teri [A]Manmani [D]Me,        Band [G]Aankhein Karun
Din Ko [D]Raatein Karun,        Teri [G]Zulfo Ko Sehla Ke [D]baate karun
Ishq [A]Mein Unn Baaton [C]se Ho,        Meethi [G]Si Naraazi [D]yaan
[D]Rakhu Chupa Ke Mai Sb Se Wo Laila..
